---

This is a child-safety-critical product (target users: ages 3-12).
Production deployments MUST satisfy the following before processing
any real child data:

  1. A signed Parental Consent record (see niki/auth/consent.py).
  2. A region-specific Privacy Policy presented to and acknowledged
     by the parent at sign-up.
  3. A documented Data Deletion workflow capable of completing within
     30 days of a verified request (PRD-v2.0 #30-day cooling).
  4. An independent Security review of the four-tier privacy classifier
     (niki/safety/privacy_tier.py) and the AES-256-GCM treehole
     encryption module (niki/treehole/encryption.py).
  5. Local regulatory compliance (COPPA, GDPR-K, etc.) signed off by
    qualified counsel.

Deployments that fail any of the above are NOT AUTHORIZED to
process real child data and may only be used for development,
testing, or research under controlled conditions.
